---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TrackedLanding from "../../components/TrackedLanding.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Quantitative Finance & Econometrics"
  description="Quantitative profile of Augusto Rico: econometrics, financial time series, forecasting, GARCH, volatility, portfolio optimization and risk analysis."
  lang="en"
  alternateEs="/finance/"
  alternateEn="/en/finance/"
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Finance · Quant · Econometrics</p>
    <h1>Finance and quantitative methods.</h1>
    <p>
      Economics training combined with research in financial time series,
      forecasting, volatility modelling and portfolio construction.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="capability-grid">
    <article class="capability">
      <span class="number">01</span>
      <h3>Forecasting</h3>
      <p>Time series, LSTM, GAM, ARIMA and forecast evaluation.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="capability">
      <span class="number">02</span>
      <h3>Risk & volatility</h3>
      <p>Volatility, GARCH, market indicators and quantitative analysis.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="capability">
      <span class="number">03</span>
      <h3>Portfolio analysis</h3>
      <p>Mean-variance optimization, Markowitz portfolios and asset analysis.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <section class="section-block">
    <p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p>
    <h2>Related research and coursework</h2>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/en/projects/rnn-vs-gam-finanzas/">RNN/LSTM vs GAM</a>
      <a class="button" href="https://github.com/LeKilleRGallet/university/blob/master/econometrics/ECONOMETRIA2/Trabajo1/main.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">ARIMA / oil exports</a>
      <a class="button" href="https://github.com/LeKilleRGallet/university/blob/master/econometrics/ECONOMETRIA2/Trabajo2/main.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Cointegration / silver</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="two-column">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Approach</p>
        <h2>Models, risk and decisions.</h2>
        <p>
          The public evidence combines time-series econometrics, forecasting, volatility
          and portfolio construction. Related work includes ARIMA, cointegration, GARCH
          and mean-variance optimization.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
        <p>
          The RNN/LSTM vs GAM manuscript links intraday forecasting and model evaluation
          to a financial decision layer through Markowitz portfolio construction.
        </p>
        <a class="button" href="/en/topics/quantitative-finance/">View topical evidence</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <TrackedLanding label="This page may register an anonymous visit when opened from a tracked application." />
</BaseLayout>
